Adam: 'The day view is bad. Look at ATOM's view of days — Daysheets,
schedule, files, contacts, flights etc. That's the standard.'

- FLIGHTS actually reach the day: the loader matched .eq(show_id) but the
  FlightsGrid creation path never sets show_id — every day rendered zero
  flights. Now flights match on the routing pin OR depart/arrive date ==
  the day (tour + workspace scoped), with passenger names resolved and a
  FlightsCard (mono times, JFK → ATL, passenger chips, conf/PNR).
- FILES on the day (real linkage found, nothing invented): rider_assets
  .routing_id + file_references linked_to_type='routing' load into a
